<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading English premier league</p>
<p>goalscorers after matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>6. Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>4. Kevin Campbell (Nottingham Forest), Les Ferdinand</p>
<p>(Newcastle), Juninho (Middlesbrough), Patrik Berger</p>
<p>(Liverpool), Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton), Eric</p>
<p>Cantona (Manchester United), Efan Ekoku (Wimbledon),</p>
<p>Frank Leboeuf (Chelsea), Alan Shearer (Newcastle),</p>
<p>Juninho (Middlesbrough)</p>
